","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/commits/6c88a609224dc2ace97a3bebcfaeeed6ffc15fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:29:04Z","email":"47294899+lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luke Chen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T05:29:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: fetch weather for specific date/time, fallback to current weather with tooltip for out-of-range dates (#8)\n\n- fetchWeather now accepts an optional targetDate parameter\n- Dates within Open-Meteo''s forecast range (16 days) use daily forecast data\n- Past dates within 92 days use historical data via past_days param\n- Dates beyond these ranges fall back to current weather with isFallback flag\n- WeatherData type extended with isFallback and fallbackReason fields\n- MapsTab passes startDate to all fetchWeather calls\n- Weather re-fetches when startDate changes (not just location)\n- ItineraryItemCard shows yellow info tooltip explaining fallback\n- Humidity hidden when unavailable (daily forecast doesn''t include it)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Luke Chen <lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac4b22ea8b497422166f36e350d652f09dd97c82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/git/trees/ac4b22ea8b497422166f36e350d652f09dd97c82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/git/commits/6c88a609224dc2ace97a3bebcfaeeed6ffc15fdf","verification":{"payload":"tree ac4b22ea8b497422166f36e350d652f09dd97c82\nparent b2f275d4ec385a5f3dd53840c48e732b375a0d0b\nauthor Luke Chen <47294899+lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com> 1772774944 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772774944 -0600\n\nfeat: fetch weather for specific date/time, fa