cc69687f92f946"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47294899?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lukechn99","id":47294899,"login":"lukechn99","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mjk0ODk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukechn99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/commits/38abb5fde064b02b11f5d535b4434ed010f81ea3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:54:36Z","email":"47294899+lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luke Chen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T02:54:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add itinerary builder to Maps tab with location search, weather markers, and local storage (#4)\n\n- Integrate itinerary management directly into the existing MapsTab\n- Add location search via OpenStreetMap Nominatim geocoding API\n- Fetch live weather data from Open-Meteo (free, no API key)\n- Custom map markers: weather emoji icon + sequence number badge\n- Dashed polyline connecting itinerary stops in order\n- Itinerary items persisted in localStorage across sessions\n- Each item card: expandable with weather details, rating, notes/review, tags\n- Datetime selectors (start/end) per itinerary stop\n- Click a card to pan the map to that location\n- Tag system with color-coded badges for organizing stops\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Luke Chen <lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cea8965407a129e9f07ee8f51d268e45a9408bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/git/trees/cea8965407a129e9f07ee8f51d268e45a9408bec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukechn99/lukechn99.github.io/git/commits/38abb5fde064b02b11f5d535b4434ed010f81ea3","verification":{"payload":"tree cea8965407a129e9f07ee8f51d268e45a9408bec\nparent 8df4b665b2210303c5beafb885b5a065397498ea\nauthor Luke Chen <47294899+lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com> 1772765676 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772765676 -0600\n\nAdd itinerary builder to Maps tab with location search, weather markers, and local storage (#4)\n\n- Integrate itinerary management directly into the existing MapsTab\n- Add location search via OpenStreetMap Nominatim geocoding API\n- Fetch live weather data from Open-Meteo (free, no API key)\n- Custom map markers: weather emoji icon + sequence number badge\n- Dashed polyline connecting itinerary stops in order\n- Itinerary items persisted in localStorage across sessions\n- Each item card: expandable with weather details, rating, notes/review, tags\n- Datetime selectors (start/end) per itinerary stop\n- Click a card to pan the map to that location\n- Tag system with color-coded badges for organizing stops\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Luke Chen <lukechn99@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqkHsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK1oQAGoo0HKx66QLqvpAHet3+fnK\ntvJm23Xdc/XbsGW2iNrqRn+BlDEnKiwmABKMtra4Y9p5Hwt51tL5VXF6cW0P4nC1\nzMIgCH3myfoyaGkJ536MOoInfUgiyoNPAFVLx7KEVV7wnljQFD9XYSBJXM7MsACs\n3dwjUVd6RUlGh30l/DgpTzxDp1b+e+5L5Oh79dZeeIv0n3IjFrILFlJpkQ0PPSi7\nj30MAwvmz1CNIBnE+rEATxt7mtr9ZloTscSxvzvl/5jC5vzdMfqGc5M3DLlHFc5G\nzeCx8h/hzZCl6AYVkUsrwDNJ09