com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"feat(app-excalidraw): add applyMermaid RPC + files persistence\n\nLets the host draw/update diagrams from Mermaid text. Registers an\n`applyMermaid({mermaid, mode})` RPC alongside `getScene`:\nparseMermaidToExcalidraw → convertToExcalidrawElements (regenerateIds so\nrepeated appends don''t collide) → placement per mode (replace-selection /\nappend below existing content / replace-all) via getCommonBounds → updateScene\n→ scrollToContent → persist. Returns {ok, mode, added, removed, error?}.\n\nAlso round-trips Excalidraw''s top-level `files` map (image blobs) through\nsave/load — a pasted image, or a Mermaid image fallback for unsupported types\n(pie/gantt/…), now survives a reopen instead of rendering broken.\n\nAdds @excalidraw/mermaid-to-excalidraw ^2.2.2 (was a transitive dep of\n@excalidraw/excalidraw 0.18.1) as a direct dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"342036757b3c96cd53365ece4f73b2f8dbafc8a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/342036757b3c96cd53365ece4f73b2f8dbafc8a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/c566fd7511724a4ec1ea9592448571a12c2987e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/c566fd7511724a4ec1ea9592448571a12c2987e7","node_id":"C_kwDOQ78T_NoAKGM1NjZmZDc1MTE3MjRhNGVjMWVhOTU5MjQ0ODU3MWExMmMyOTg3ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd","sha":"9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd"}],"sha":"c566fd7511724a4ec1ea9592448571a12c2987e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/c566fd7511724a4ec1ea9592448571a12c2987e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:08:52Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:08:52Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"chore(app-excalidraw): bump @excalidraw/excalidraw 0.17.6 → 0.18.1\n\n0.18 adds the richer property panel (arrow types, edges, more font\ncontrols, etc.) the older build lacked. It also stopped auto-injecting\nits stylesheet and moved fonts behind EXCALIDRAW_ASSET_PATH, so:\n- import \"@excalidraw/excalidraw/index.css\" explicitly (App.tsx);\n- set window.EXCALIDRAW_ASSET_PATH = \"./\" so fonts resolve to the\n  guest''s /fonts (main.tsx) — works offline in the Tauri shell;\n- copy the package fonts next to the bundle via vite-plugin-static-copy.\n\nReact stays 18 (0.18 peer-deps allow ^18.2). Verified inside AsciiMark:\nthe editor loads styled and the full Stroke/Background/Sloppiness/Edges/\nOpacity panel renders.","tree":{"sha":"f9d52c44ceda65c57fb31db20184b5bb49436a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/f9d52c44ceda65c57fb31db20184b5bb49436a67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd","node_id":"C_kwDOQ78T_NoAKDlmZTZiMmVmMjQzYTJkYTgxZGZhNzE4ZGIwMmRlMmQ4ODE1NmQ1Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148","sha":"358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148"}],"sha":"9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/9fe6b2ef243a2da81dfa718db02de2d88156d5cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:26:58Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T13:26:58Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"fix(frame): exclude reserved props from the dynamic-method proxy\n\nThe prototype proxy returned a function for any unknown camelCase property,\nmaking the element accidentally thenable (then) and fabricating Custom Element\nreaction callbacks (adoptedCallback) the class does not implement. Both were\ninvoked with the wrong this (the prototype or a foreign receiver) and threw\n\"Illegal invocation\". Exclude the Promise protocol and the reaction callbacks\nfrom dynamic-method dispatch. Bump to 1.2.4.","tree":{"sha":"2466b74d3b6faf4172c2e6d6c4b71572e843b3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/2466b74d3b6faf4172c2e6d6c4b71572e843b3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/358c970fe481024d1afd51cd07ed8e09d69ad148","node