react''s @zomme/frame peer to ^1.2.3 and add files: [\"dist\"].","tree":{"sha":"b8bc37e5d9a0e0b928bffaa870337c49e637aecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/b8bc37e5d9a0e0b928bffaa870337c49e637aecb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/3dd3af900c1edf7c7bad7d707c8ed42c4f9f8347","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/3dd3af900c1edf7c7bad7d707c8ed42c4f9f8347","node_id":"C_kwDOQ78T_NoAKDNkZDNhZjkwMGMxZWRmN2M3YmFkN2Q3MDdjOGVkNDJjNGY5ZjgzNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr/frame/commit/12e441bf590c7965bd0b6797bfc6bbbe6f811dba","sha":"12e441bf590c7965bd0b6797bfc6bbbe6f811dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/12e441bf590c7965bd0b6797bfc6bbbe6f811dba"}],"sha":"3dd3af900c1edf7c7bad7d707c8ed42c4f9f8347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/3dd3af900c1edf7c7bad7d707c8ed42c4f9f8347"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/commits/12e441bf590c7965bd0b6797bfc6bbbe6f811dba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:58:20Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:58:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: SolidJS frame binding + Excalidraw editor over z-frame (#3)\n\n* feat: SolidJS frame binding + Excalidraw editor over z-frame\n\n- @zomme/frame-solid: Solid host wrapper (no-JSX) + createFrameSDK guest primitive\n- apps/shell-solid: Solid host PoC embedding guests through z-frame\n- apps/app-excalidraw: React Excalidraw editor guest (load/save via Frame RPC)\n- register frame-solid + new apps in scripts/build.ts\n- pin yallist@3.1.1 override so lru-cache (CJS) unblocks vite-plugin-solid\n\n* fix(app-excalidraw): reliable load + move save ownership to the host\n\nLoad: react to the reactive `drawingData` prop (useSyncExternalStore) and\napply it once excalidrawAPI is ready, instead of watchProps (change-only),\nwhich dropped the initial handshake delivery and left the editor empty on\nreopen. Sig-gated so unrelated re-renders never clobber the user''s edits.\n\nSave: stop owning the debounce inside the iframe; push the current scene to\nthe host on each coalesced change. A tab switch unmounts the iframe, so a\ndebounce living here lost the last edit; the host now debounces and flushes.","tree":{"sha":"001a3f0b25d815aa5a188ae8840df95a223864be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/001a3f0b25d815aa5a188ae8840df95a223864be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/12e441bf590c7965bd0b6797bfc6bbbe6f811dba","verification":{"payload":"tree 001a3f0b25d815aa5a188ae8840df95a223864be\nparent bb8713123250a9833ee8da8bf94d8c18123ed7cf\nauthor Djalma Júnior <djalmajr@gmail.com> 1780531100 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780531100 -0300\n\nfeat: SolidJS frame binding + Excalidraw editor over z-frame (#3)\n\n* feat: SolidJS frame binding + Excalidraw editor over z-frame\n\n- @zomme/frame-solid: Solid host wrapper (no-JSX) + createFrameSDK guest primitive\n- apps/shell-solid: Solid host PoC embedding guests through z-frame\n- apps/app-excalidraw: React Excalidraw editor guest (load/save via Frame RPC)\n- register frame-solid + new apps in scripts/build.ts\n- pin yallist@3.1.1 override so lru-cache (CJS) unblocks vite-plugin-solid\n\n* fix(app-excalidraw): reliable load + move save ownership to the host\n\nLoad: react to the reactive `drawingData` prop (useSyncExternalStore) and\napply it once excalidrawAPI is ready, instead of watchProps (change-only),\nwhich dropped the initial handshake delivery and left the editor empty on\nreopen. Sig-gated so unrelated re-renders never clobber the user''s edits.\n\nSave: stop owning the debounce inside the iframe; push the current scene to\nthe host on each coalesced change. A tab switch unmounts the iframe, so a\ndebounce living here lost the last edit; the host now debounces and flushes.","reason":"valid","signatu