t strategy similar to Angular/Vue (compare lastEmittedPath)\n\n- Fix: Lint errors across all packages\n  - Add type=\"button\" to all React buttons\n  - Remove unused variables (user, _user)\n  - Fix useEffect hook dependencies\n  - Update array syntax (Array<T> → T[])\n  - Use useRef instead of useMemo for props in frame-react\n\n- Chore: Generate TypeScript declaration files (.d.ts)\n  - Add vue-shim.d.ts for Vue component support\n  - Fix type exports in all packages\n  - Resolve \"Could not find declaration file\" errors\n\nAll applications (Angular, React, Vue) now correctly synchronize routes\nwith the shell, without race conditions on multiple refreshes.","tree":{"sha":"c85b5926f55b30040931c2e6f7453ae6b9bb10a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/c85b5926f55b30040931c2e6f7453ae6b9bb10a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/7f41d001b70a1a0792c44ca64216a9be359f6c97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h