alma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T17:36:56Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"feat(fragment-frame): add register() method and fix function deserialization\n\nAdd frameSDK.register() method for cleaner function registration API and fix bug where functions in CUSTOM_EVENT were not properly deserialized.\n\n- Add frameSDK.register() method with dual overload support (single function and multiple functions)\n- Fix deserialization bug in CUSTOM_EVENT handler where functions were received as tokens instead of callable proxies\n- Add comprehensive JSDoc documentation for FragmentFrameProps and register() method\n- Update function-serialization.adoc with register() examples and recommended patterns\n- Update sdk.adoc with complete API reference for register() method\n- Add 11 unit tests for register() type validation and functionality\n- Add 6 integration tests for end-to-end registration flow\n- Configure biome.json to ignore lint rules for fragment-frame package\n- Remove unused SERIALIZATION_MAX_DEPTH import\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb5f4b94196d1bf9e92f13bb1f9ac5365245d372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/bb5f4b94196d1bf9e92f13bb1f9ac5365245d372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/ec0d19c606f529d04f38a331c6cf579cf079eb52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=