cd39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T12:07:26Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T12:07:26Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"Add initial micro-frontend architecture with Angular, React, Solid, and Vue applications\n\n- Created a monorepo structure with multiple micro-apps using Angular, React, Solid, and Vue.\n- Added shared SDK for communication between micro-apps.\n- Implemented basic routing and event handling in each micro-app.\n- Included configuration files, build scripts, and documentation for each framework.\n- Established a common package for shared components and utilities.\n\nThis commit sets up the foundational architecture for a micro-frontend application, enabling independent deployment and communication between various frameworks.","tree":{"sha":"3a373647a617dd80afd29d85e004890fbabe088d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/trees/3a373647a617dd80afd29d85e004890fbabe088d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djalmajr/frame/git/commits/3f969436842c17621c1088ca7ab2eea06e09cd39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d