ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/77d928b23bf1e2cec671028b69c1bc780d37b5a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:08:11Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:09:06Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Otto: keep the plan card up through a build + animate the status dot (#88, #89)\n\nA build failure sent the user back to plain chat with the plan gone, so a\nretry meant re-planning from scratch instead of clicking Approve again on\nthe same plan (#89). The plan card now stays visible through the build and\non failure the same button offers a one-click retry (\"Try again\"); a\n\"Building...\" line is posted to the chat when the build starts, so the\ntranscript reflects what''s happening instead of going quiet.\n\nThe status bubble''s dot was static regardless of state, so \"Otto is\nworking\" had no visible motion of its own (#88). It now pulses with a\nsmall expanding ring while thinking or building, mirroring the working cue\nOttoFigure already gives to the Orb itself.","tree":{"sha":"19d0f209c9e3de62c98d32c2d12fd9d3cea8c2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/19d0f209c9e3de62c98d32c2d12fd9d3cea8c2fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/77d928b23bf1e2cec671028b69c1bc780d37b5a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified