:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/5176d53aca46d02491c92524552471767f8cce53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:39:12Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:39:12Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Otto UI after the demo: bubble, thinking animation, Hebrew font, Beta tag (#78, #79, #82)\n\n#78.1 - the status bubble sat pinned to the top of the rail with a\ncolumn of empty panel between it and Otto. The auto margin moved to\nthe card, so card and figure travel to the bottom together and what\nOtto says is directly above him.\n\n#78.2 - thinking spun a dark dashed iris across the near-black face:\nit covered the eyes and the two darks muddied into each other. The\neyes now stay open and the motion is a comet of accent dots orbiting\nOUTSIDE the porthole, on the light body where the accent actually\nreads.\n\n#79 - Schibsted Grotesk and Public Sans carry no Hebrew glyphs, so\nevery Hebrew string in Intelligence fell through to the system font -\nmost visible on the app title at 24px/800 on the building screen.\nAdded Assistant (this repo''s Hebrew face already) to the loader and\nbetween the Latin font and system-ui in both tokens; fallback is\nper-glyph, so Latin is untouched.\n\n#82 - the Beta tag was a muted outline nobody read as a label. Filled\nin the client''s own accent. While there: the Otto tiles referenced\n--ai-primary, which is defined nowhere, so they always rendered the\nhardcoded purple instead of the client''s brand - pointed at\n--ai-accent.\n\nVerified in a browser on the aspect demo dataset: pill filled in the\nbrand blue, Assistant in the computed font stack, orbit present and\nthe old iris gone in the think state, card-to-figure gap 14px at the\nbottom of the rail, no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4798c7af89b0e2a32b6ef3b6895f10c6448a024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/f4798c7af89b0e2a32b6ef3b6895f10c6448a024"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/5176d53aca46d02491c92524552471767f8cce53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/5176d53aca46d02491c92524552471767f8cce53","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8KAw9oAKDUxNzZkNTNhY2E0NmQwMjQ5MWM5MjUyNDU1MjQ3MTc2N2Y4Y2NlNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/1925eff017a47360e14d268786f794e038d6da3f","sha":"1925eff017a47360e14d268786f794e038d6da3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/1925eff017a47360e14d268786f794e038d6da3f"}],"sha":"5176d53aca46d02491c92524552471767f8cce53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/5176d53aca46d02491c92524552471767f8cce53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/1925eff017a47360e14d268786f794e038d6da3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:29:32Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:29:32Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Intelligence: customer-first URLs (task #75, narrowed scope)\n\n/intelligence/:datasetId was the one route family that put the section\nbefore the customer, inconsistent with /:agent/admin and /:agent/chat\nwhich were already customer-first. New canonical pattern:\n/:datasetId/intelligence[/...]. Deliberately NOT touching the old bare\nper-agent chat links (/zer4u, /aspect, /freeda) - those need a separate\ndecision from Shlomi about the login-wall/localStorage-key mismatch\n(see task #75''s own comment thread); this migration only covers the\nthree literal examples Shlomi gave.\n\nEvery old /intelligence/:datasetId/* address keeps working via a\nredirect (IntelligenceLegacyRedirect, query string preserved) rather\nthan breaking - purchasing and builder get their own redirects\nstraight to the new destination so they don''t bounce through two hops.\nAll internal navigation (IntelligenceShell, CustomScreenRouter,\nReportsPage, IntelligenceHome, IntelligenceAdminPage) now builds the\nnew canonical path directly.\n\n/intelligence/zolstock is also a live share-preview link (firebase.json\nrewrite + inject-share-pages.cjs, added 2026-09-14 specifically to fix\nbad WhatsApp/Slack previews) - kept its entry untouched so that\nalready-shared link''s card doesn''t regress, and added a matching entry\nfor /zolstock/intelligence so sharing the new canonical link previews\njust as well going forward.\n\nVerified locally: old bare/apps(+query)/purchasing/builder all land on\nthe correct new URL in one hop, new URLs load directly, no console\nerrors, page renders correctly after redirect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9c34b02ae7af629e1b93bc940d1e3a5e3a586b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/g