users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/8f32ef617fef0215bdd98bd3faaaaab04298bc35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:11:21Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:11:21Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Task board: restore direct links to a task (?task=<id>)\n\nThe new per-client board (src/taskboard/) already had a \"Copy link\"\nbutton in TaskFormModal that built a ?task=<id> URL - nothing ever\nread that param, so the copied link just landed on the board with no\ntask open, unlike the old board''s working /tasks/:taskId. Kosta hit\nthis on zolstock.\n\nTaskBoardPage now seeds openId from ?task on mount and keeps the URL\nin sync (replace, not push) whenever a task opens or closes, so the\nexisting Copy link button works and any task can be bookmarked or\nshared directly.\n\nVerified: navigating straight to ?task=77 opens task #77 with its\nfull detail and comments; clicking a card sets ?task=<id>; closing\nclears it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":