 Apps shelf, not after - real and\nin-progress things beat the empty invitation to start a new one.\n\nVerified with a local server + Playwright against real zolstock data:\ntile order and Beta pill render correctly, Otto opens full screen,\nBack button returns to the Apps shelf with the normal chrome restored,\nProcurement is untouched, no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3aa069cf04643d2c2453f88f35fe46085e426b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/a3aa069cf04643d2c2453f88f35fe46085e426b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/f78281b875d2422ba15d4d817af7f80874b41ab6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/f78281b875d2422ba15d4d817af7f80874b41ab6","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8KAw9oAKGY3ODI4MWI4NzVkMjQyMmJhMTVkNGQ4MTdhZjdmODA4NzRiNDFhYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/