ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/7345e3000cf9c65e806de4cb5b7c13b1373e7524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:13:14Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:13:14Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"message":"Otto client: app wording, Draft breadcrumbs, suggestion chips, edit/revert flow\n\n- terminology sweep: screen → app across all otto.* strings, both locales;\n  the job pill reads \"Creating app\"\n- breadcrumbs: custom apps report their own leaf (builder: \"Draft - <name>\",\n  published page: the name) via the shell''s insight-crumb pattern\n- tap-to-answer chips under Otto''s replies compose into the input, one line\n  per press — never auto-send\n- revision semantics: a message after a build resets the step strip to Chat\n  and the badge to Draft (the built version stays on the canvas); \"Ready\n  for review\" only right after this round''s build\n- published page gains \"Edit app\" (+ warning dialog → unpublish → builder);\n  ever-published apps show \"Cancel changes\" instead of Delete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0121746828b3659b0225eef40be293bab6c9451","url":"http