":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"message":"Otto figure: unconditional motion + state enter/exit choreography; chat sends UI language\n\n- OttoFigure: the OS reduced-motion flag froze the Orb completely on the\n  owner''s machine (second occurrence) — removed by owner override; every\n  state now enters with a springy pop and thinking gets a spin-up beat\n  before the steady orbit, so start/during/result read as distinct moments\n- chat calls carry the shell''s EN/HE toggle so Otto answers in the\n  interface language (server counterpart on the same branch)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cc1f655730272b3f2426104ddc710cdbed6abfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/1cc1f655730272b3f2426104ddc710cdbed6abfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/c1c0e3f1c610eb16c7d53970ee560b429eca2b6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/c1c0e3f1c610eb16c7d53970ee560b429eca2b6d","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8KAw9oAKGMxYzBlM2YxYzYxMGViMTZjN2Q1Mzk3MGVlNTYwYjQyOWVjYTJiNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/97772b1706bdd214d3849b22fb883a857e461e33","sha":"97772b1706bdd214d3849b22fb883a857e461e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/97772b1706bdd214d3849b22fb883a857e461e33"}],"sha":"c1c0e3f1c610eb16c7d53970ee560b429eca2b6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/c1c0e3f1c610eb16c7d53970ee560b429eca2b6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/97772b1706bdd214d3849b22fb883a857e461e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:34:28Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:34:28Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"message":"fix(otto): first Send no longer resets the builder — the draft''s creator keeps its mount\n\nCreating the draft swaps /apps/new to /apps/<id>; the router refetched,\nskeletoned and REMOUNTED the builder, which read the not-yet-persisted\nconversation back as empty — to the user, Send \"reloaded the page\" and the\nin-flight reply died in the unmounted instance. The router now tracks the\ndraft it created (ownedId) and keeps the same element position so React\nupdates props instead of remounting; the builder skips reloading a screen\nit already holds. Publish releases ownership and refetches so the same URL\nflips to the published page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68579744bd022dc9a827542eb46623aa1e90732a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/68579744bd022dc9a827542eb46623aa1e90732a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/97772b1706bdd214d3849b22fb883a857e461e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user