ps://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/236bc0c36447e9457d5a34e7c8886b12e6c633bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:30:24Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T01:30:24Z","email":"vlyahov@gmail.com","name":"vlyahov"},"message":"Otto v2 client: in-shell builder, block catalog, custom screens on the Apps shelf\n\nThe client half of the Otto rework (server branch of the same name; spec in\nits tasks/pending/otto-intelligence-integration.md). v1''s standalone\nHebrew-only page and its demo assets are removed; the old /builder route\nredirects into the shell.\n\n- Apps/custom/: OttoBuilder (three-panel page per the M2-M4 mockups: chat\n  rail with the structured plan card, status panel with the animated\n  OttoFigure Orb, canvas with live build stages), ScreenRenderer + the\n  block catalog (kpiCards, filterBar, sortable dataTable, chart via\n  InsightChart, actionsBar with working CSV export, noteLine quoting\n  manifest caveats), CustomScreenPage (published screens, native — no\n  iframe), CustomScreenRouter (status decides the surface)\n- Shelf: \"New screen — with OTTO\" tile when the module is live, custom\n  tiles with draft dots; hasApps now mirrors the server rule (apps OR\n  canCreate OR custom) so Otto-only clients get the tab\n- Shell: /apps/:appId generalized past the replenishment hardcode;\n  breadcrumb is appId-aware; build progress rides the existing job pill\n- ottoService over apiRequest; types/otto.ts mirrors the server contract;\n  full otto.* i18n in both locales; builds registered with useJobs so the\n  header pill follows real polled progress\n\ntsc, eslint and the production build are clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04ef3f9a874e92f2be6b1e581f261b12e20faa5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/04ef3f9a874e92f2be6b1e581f261b12e20faa5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/236bc0c36447e9457d5a34e7c8886b12e6c633bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141661619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JuzzztMe","id":141661619,"login":"JuzzztMe","node_id":"U_kgDOCHGVsw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JuzzztMe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/236bc0c36447e9457d5a34e7c8886b12e6c633bf","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8KAw9oAKDIzNmJjMGMzNjQ0N2U5NDU3ZDVhMzRlN2M4ODg2YjEyZTZjNjMzYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commit/ec87d0b9230b90cd03a90eb794dcb8aabd7d32d7","sha":"ec87d0b9230b90cd03a90eb794dcb8aabd7d32d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/ec87d0b9230b90cd03a90eb794dcb8aabd7d32d7"}],"sha":"236bc0c36447e9457d5a34e7c8886b12e6c633bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/236bc0c36447e9457d5a34e7c8886b12e6c633bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/ec87d0b9230b90cd03a90eb794dcb8aabd7d32d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:40:12Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T15:40:12Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Redesign Settings > Schedule tab: group by project, show durations, timeline\n\nKosta''s feedback on the flat schedule table: hard to see it''s really 7\nprojects (name repeated on every row), no sense of how long a full\nimport+index cycle actually takes, no way to see whether the scheduled\ngaps between projects are enough.\n\n- One card per project (Drive Sync + Import together, grouped) instead\n  of a flat list of {project, job} rows.\n- Each card shows the last full cycle''s duration and row count (from the\n  new GET /api/admin/scheduler/last-runs), or an explicit warning when\n  indexing hasn''t caught up to the latest import / the import failed —\n  this immediately surfaced a real issue: zolstock''s last index run\n  failed and nothing has re-indexed since.\n- A shared 24h timeline, one lane per project: Drive Sync and Import\n  markers plus a duration bar for the last cycle. Two independent visual\n  signals so they don''t get conflated: bar fill = that project''s own\n  health (green/red), amber outline = this project''s time window\n  overlaps another project''s (the actual DB-contention question, not\n  the same thing as either project being unhealthy).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51afd8ec2abea7f9b738a3d6269f9ab822a1516c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/51afd8ec2abea7f9b738a3d6269f9ab822a1516c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/ec87d0b9230b90cd03a90eb794dcb8aabd7d32d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj