4T13:52:41Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Task #71: drop the orphaned subtitle next to a real client logo\n\nbrandSub (\"AI-powered business intelligence\") was left showing on its own\nafter task #71''s earlier same-day fix removed brandName next to a logo —\na line of text floating with nothing above it and no visual tie to the\nlogo, reported as \"terrible located\" with a screenshot. Now the whole\nname+subtitle text block is scoped to the initials-mark fallback only,\nwhich needs it to read as a brand at all; a real logo image stands on\nits own, same reasoning as the brandName removal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ecfdc53613de3baf4fcb19a2241378cdc8b6481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/trees/4ecfdc53613de3baf4fcb19a2241378cdc8b6481"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/git/commits/f5d3213c1fa237afdf8f2ba3d512cc573b1c5b11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4075694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zib4ik","id":4075694,"login":"Zib4ik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzU2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co