s://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zib4ik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShlomiZevin/aspect-agent-client-react/commits/da46f053f539096d1e99f66f732b6408664fbebc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:37:46Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T11:37:46Z","email":"ziben.konstantin@gmail.com","name":"Ziben Konstantin"},"message":"Fix missing/empty WhatsApp link previews (Shlomi report, 2026-09-14)\n\nindex.html shipped with no default OG/Twitter tags at all (just a\nplaceholder <title>AI Agent</title>), so any route without its own\ninject-share-pages.cjs override — e.g. /intelligence/superhist — previewed\nwith no title/image, and lybi.ai had the exact same gap.\n\n- inject-share-pages.cjs now takes a target arg and, before writing any\n  per-route override, first rewrites dist/index.html''s own title/OG/Twitter\n  tags in place from a per-target default (aspect, lybi-prod) — every route\n  on that target inherits it unless a specific PAGES entry overrides it.\n  Strips any existing title/meta/og/twitter tags first so re-running the\n  script, or layering a route override on top of the new default, can never\n  leave duplicate tags behind.\n- Two new cards rendered via the existing scripts/og/render.cjs pipeline\n  (real webfonts via headless Chrome, not a hand-drawn image): a generic\n  Aspect Intelligence card and a LYBI card using LYBI''s own brand gradient\n  and real spiral logo, headline/subhead lifted from the actual landing\n  page hero.\n- deploy:aspect and deploy:lybi-prod now both run the injection step\n  (deploy:lybi-prod never ran any version 