},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T04:04:50Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"refactor(frame-angular): replace component wrapper with native Web Component usage\n\nRemove FrameComponent wrapper and simplify Angular integration to use native <z-frame> directly. Add FrameActionsService pattern for registering callable functions from parent shell. Improve prop injection with PropsProxy for reactive property access.\n\n- Remove frame.component.ts wrapper in favor of direct <z-frame> usage\n- Add FrameActionsService for bi-directional function registration\n- Enhance FramePropsService with PropsProxy for ergonomic prop access\n- Update shell-angular to demonstrate new action registration pattern\n- Improve SDK initialization with onReady callback support\n- Update documentation to reflect new architecture","tree":{"sha":"7f25527cc26a91f41f500ad86fb85e43325e8add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/git/trees/7f25527cc26a91f41f500ad86fb85e43325e8add"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/git/commits/019f7633e9dcc0025b5b912c3b67a6b4579f335c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/andersonmfjr/frame/commit/019f7633e9dcc0025b5b912c3b67a6b4579f335c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8L6Y9oAKDAxOWY3NjMzZTlkY2MwMDI1YjViOTEyYzNiNjdhNmI0NTc5ZjMzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/andersonmfjr/frame/commit/356997eadc0abe3c5b80a9eb1e5381005a6e8157","sha":"356997eadc0abe3c5b80a9eb1e5381005a6e8157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/commits/356997eadc0abe3c5b80a9eb1e5381005a6e8157"}],"sha":"019f7633e9dcc0025b5b912c3b67a6b4579f335c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/commits/019f7633e9dcc0025b5b912c3b67a6b4579f335c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/commits/356997eadc0abe3c5b80a9eb1e5381005a6e8157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-18T02:10:37Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T02:10:37Z","email":"djalmajr@gmail.com","name":"Djalma Júnior"},"message":"refactor: rename fragment-frame to frame and simplify architecture\n\nMajor refactoring to improve naming consistency and simplify the micro-frontend framework architecture.\n\nPackage renaming:\n- @zomme/fragment-frame → @zomme/frame\n- @zomme/fragment-frame-angular → @zomme/frame-angular\n- @zomme/fragment-frame-react → @zomme/frame-react\n- @zomme/fragment-frame-vue → @zomme/frame-vue\n\nComponent renaming:\n- FragmentFrame → Frame\n- fragment-props.ts → frame-props.ts\n- fragment-frame.component.ts → frame.component.ts\n\nAdditional changes:\n- Add MIT license\n- Add AGENTS.md documentation\n- Update all imports and references across apps\n- Remove navigation.interceptor.ts (no longer needed)\n- Add publish script for package distribution\n- Update documentation and README files","tree":{"sha":"fd23cb35a44219709899e94f065b3fe579ae8196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/git/trees/fd23cb35a44219709899e94f065b3fe579ae8196"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andersonmfjr/frame/git/commits/356997eadc0abe3c5b80a9eb1e5381005a6e8157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1858147?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djalmajr","id":1858147,"login":"djalmajr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTgxNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djalmajr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.