 matrix\n- Trim io-package news to the 7 most recent versions\n- Complete i18n translations for es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, ru, uk, zh-cn\n- Logo is now a valid JPEG, referenced consistently as utility-monitor.jpg\n- CSV import now reports archived record/year counts, with a clear note\n  when all rows are from the current year (not archived to history states)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"389e24a16d7d739333b0d43556967c754a9dac87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/389e24a16d7d739333b0d43556967c754a9dac87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/6820fe1f329de996fe013b9f41875bd570659f71","verification":{"payload":"tree 389e24a16d7d739333b0d43556967c754a9dac87\nparent 211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791388707 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791388707 +0000\n\nchore: collective repository-checker fixes and clearer import feedback (v1.7.3)\n\n- Bump @iobroker/testing to ^6.3.0\n- Add Node.js 26.x to the CI adapter-tests matrix\n- Trim io-package news to the 7 most recent versions\n- Complete i18n translations for es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, ru, uk, zh-cn\n- Logo is now a valid JPEG, referenced consistently as utility-monitor.jpg\n- CSV import now reports archived record/year counts, with a clear note\n  when all rows are from the current year (not archived to history states)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDa1UxUH\nZCVKhw2KwR7ieHByyVlfReWVQa4AGuMJuhJVhXzhlaMJcQhZeQSqZ+Meu3l3G0aY5n427r9g1yNW\nKQE=\n-----END