","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:08:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T16:08:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: CSV import sendTo now reaches the backend (v1.7.2)\n\nWith useNative:true the sendTo delivered an empty obj.message, so\nhandleImportCSV returned at the ''!obj.message'' guard before doing anything\n- no log output, and Admin showed a delayed generic ''OK'' (reported on\nAdmin 8, #48).\n\nSend type + meterName explicitly via jsonData so obj.message is populated\nand the importCSV handler actually runs. The (multi-line) CSV content is\nread from the saved native config (importCsvContent) instead of being\nsqueezed through jsonData string templating. Flow: paste -> Save -> Start\nimport; a localized success/error message is returned to the button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"4de5e9d764fe8171c15c1b4ef5d9bf65117a0848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/4de5e9d764fe8171c15c1b4ef5d9bf65117a0848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 4de5e9d764fe8171c15c1b4ef5d9bf65117a0848\nparent e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788278886 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788278886 +0000\n\nfix: CSV import sendTo now reaches the backend (v1.7.2)\n\nWith useNative:true the sendTo delivered an empty obj.message, so\nhandleImportCSV returned at the ''!obj.message'' guard before doing anything\n- no log output, and Admin showed a delayed generic ''OK'' (reported on\nAdmin 8, #48).\n\nSend type + meterName explicitly via jsonData so obj.message is populated\nand the importCSV handler actually runs. The (multi-line) CSV content is\nread from the saved native config (importCsvContent) instead of being\nsqueezed through jsonData string templating. Flow: paste -> Save -> Start\nimport; a localized success/error message is returned to the button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDNPGFZ/\niverWzx3W8HoXtOChna5YHZ/4MRTB3bOg8v9sN4/CJsg9+pPBdBoxf1YCN7B1nA5A541O2Yl703t\nuwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T16:08:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8R_l9oAKDIxMWM1MDYwYjc5M2QzMWU1YzQ2MjU3ODg0NTRiN2RjOTE0ZWY5Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d","sha":"e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d"}],"sha":"211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/211c5060b793d31e5c4625788454b7dc914ef9ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T11:58:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T11:58:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: remove invalid jsonConfig props that broke the import tab (v1.7.1)\n\nHomeworker11''s Admin 8 log showed the import panel was schema-invalid:\n''utility-monitor has an invalid jsonConfig ... additionalProperty\n\"showProcessMessage\" ... must NOT have additional properties''.\n\nAn invalid property makes the whole tabImport schema invalid, so the\n''Start import'' sendTo button was inert (no backend call, no log output).\n\nRemove the invalid ''showProcessMessage'' from the sendTo button and the\ninvalid ''minRows'' from the CSV text field. The import tab is now valid\nand the button reaches the importCSV backend again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"31ab7a173333bf8038925d5ea1becc4f6f0a4665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/31ab7a173333bf8038925d5ea1becc4f6f0a4665"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d","verification":{"payload":"tree 31ab7a173333bf8038925d5ea1becc4f6f0a4665\nparent fde28fbb5c9ccfe4547301dd602dfced96d7d3f8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788091106 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788091112 +0000\n\nfix: remove invalid jsonConfig props that broke the import tab (v1.7.1)\n\nHomeworker11''s Admin 8 log showed the import panel was schema-invalid:\n''utility-monitor has an invalid jsonConfig ... additionalProperty\n\"showProcessMessage\" ... must NOT have additional properties''.\n\nAn invalid property makes the whole tabImport schema invalid, so the\n''Start import'' sendTo button was inert (no backend call, no log output).\n\nRemove the invalid ''showProcessMessage'' from the sendTo button and the\ninvalid ''minRows'' from the CSV text field. The import tab is now valid\nand the button reaches the importCSV backend again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIxaL5jh\nYDVretzPSBo60MNSjIUfbm3GsHEqJatxa5xXgVWtkYSFLgaWIW+ejInoICaEw21/eAT6Ar4bXu2g\nMQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T11:58:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/e1002a045cbd9584988b48caffb81e38d34d2e8d","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8R_l9oAKGUxMDAyYTA0NWNiZDk1ODQ5ODhiNDhjYWZmYjgxZTM4ZDM0ZDJlOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/fde28fbb5c9ccfe4547301dd602dfced96d7d3f8","sha":"fde28fbb5c9ccfe4547