hor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/56297071a414ad5cea14b35c8724b1dd31893e7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:30:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T09:30:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: CSV import compatible with Admin 8 via native jsonConfig (v1.7.0)\n\nThe CSV import used a custom Module-Federation UI component targeting\n''GUI API generation 1''. Admin 8 (generation 2) refuses to start it, so\nthe import tab failed for Admin 8 users (#48, #10).\n\nReplace the custom component with native jsonConfig controls:\n- utility type (select), meter name (text), CSV content (multiline text)\n- a sendTo button with useNative:true, so the saved native config is sent\n  to the existing importCSV backend (no fragile jsonData string templating)\n\nimportManager.handleImportCSV now reads importType/importMeter/\nimportCsvContent (native) with backward-compat for the old type/meterName/\ncontent fields, validates input, and returns a localized result message.\n\nAlso:\n- remove the obsolete admin/src-admin sources and admin/custom build output,\n  drop the /admin/src-admin Dependabot block and the admin/custom npm files entry\n- make two date-based multiMeterManager tests deterministic (setDate(1) before\n  setMonth(-6) so month-end days like the 29th don''t overflow into the next month)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"9c0675826ad40deff96b3a44a71bb834cfe9ac69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/9c0675826ad40deff96b3a44a71bb834cfe9ac69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/56297071a414ad5cea14b35c8724b1dd31893e7a","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c0675826ad40deff96b3a44a71bb834cfe9ac69\nparent b998127dc624247626942edf2733c75c6cd8b151\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787995816 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787995836 +0000\n\nfix: CSV import compatible with Admin 8 via native jsonConfig (v1.7.0)\n\nThe CSV import used a custom Module-Federation UI component targeting\n''GUI API generation 1''. Admin 8 (generation 2) refuses to start it, so\nthe import tab failed for Admin 8 users (#48, #10).\n\nReplace the custom component with native jsonConfig controls:\n- utility type (select), meter name (text), CSV content (multiline text)\n- a sendTo button with useNative:true, so the saved native config is sent\n  to the existing importCSV backend (no fragile jsonData string templating)\n\nimportManager.handleImportCSV now reads importType/importMeter/\nimportCsvContent (native) with backward-compat for the old type/meterName/\ncontent fields, validates input, and returns a localized result message.\n\nAlso:\n- remove the obsolete admin/src-admin sources and admin/custom build output,\n  drop the /admin/src-admin Dependabot block and the admin/custom npm files entry\n- make two date-based multiMeterManager tests deterministic (setDate(1) before\n  setMonth(-6) so month-end days like the 29th don''t overflow into the next month)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBuE/Eru\n7RlcTHkR8InTzh51yR+3D6HMzmx75NIYvWm+Sfprhvz9NKy7cMTDmNnr5n+1x2DXyFqAjApcMqkn\nGAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T09:30:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/56297071a414ad5cea14b35c8724b1dd31893e7a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8R_l9oAKDU2Mjk3MDcxYTQxNGFkNWNlYTE0YjM1Yzg3MjRiMWRkMzE4OTNlN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/b998127dc624247626942edf2733c75c6cd8b151","sha":"b998127dc624247626942edf2733c75c6cd8b151","url":"https://api.github.com