facing notifications language-aware (en default, de) (v1.6.8)\n\nFollow-up to the ioBroker repository review: user output must be English\nor multilingual with English as default. All user-facing text in the\nmessaging handler - the test message, billing/contract reminders, the\nmonthly report and the config popups - is now localized via a small\nlanguage helper. English is the default; German is used automatically\nwhen the ioBroker system language is German, so German users keep German\nmessages without excluding other locales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"5c4931150180b680b048b99238b51a2063e094af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/5c4931150180b680b048b99238b51a2063e094af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/73b858efd16d921cfe4a60cf0463e12dcf3a8efc","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c4931150180b680b048b99238b51a2063e094af\nparent 6b240da656c5553791c78d6c5de991fa475257e9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787149537 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787149556 +0000\n\nfix: make user-facing notifications language-aware (en default, de) (v1.6.8)\n\nFollow-up to the ioBroker repository review: user output must be English\nor multilingual with English as default. All user-facing text in the\nmessaging handler - the test message, billing/contract reminders, the\nmonthly report and the config popups - is now localized via a small\nlanguage helper. English is the default; German is used automatically\nwhen the ioBroker system language is German, so German users keep German\nmessages without excluding other locales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkA