"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commits/5111fc09c638c49447364b2fbe2341506ec2cad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T10:58:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T10:58:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci(dependabot): ignore frontend framework major bumps for Admin 7\n\nThe custom jsonConfig CSV importer shares React, MUI and adapter-react-v5\nas singletons with the ioBroker.admin runtime. While the stable Admin\nrelease is 7.x (React 18 / MUI 5), major bumps of these packages would\nbreak the component at runtime for all users. Ignore semver-major updates\nfor react, react-dom, their type packages, @mui/material,\n@mui/icons-material, @emotion/react, @emotion/styled and adapter-react-v5\nso they are upgraded deliberately together with the Admin 8 migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b","tree":{"sha":"ce5df30080f2f3415b8d0091a48531816e3e1743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/trees/ce5df30080f2f3415b8d0091a48531816e3e1743"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/git/commits/5111fc09c638c49447364b2fbe2341506ec2cad3","verification":{"payload":"tree ce5df30080f2f3415b8d0091a48531816e3e1743\nparent 2ae32903c31cfb793aa238097a0493de57fa8ac7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786273132 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786273139 +0000\n\nci(dependabot): ignore frontend framework major bumps for Admin 7\n\nThe custom jsonConfig CSV importer shares React, MUI and adapter-react-v5\nas singletons with the ioBroker.admin runtime. While the stable Admin\nrelease is 7.x (React 18 / MUI 5), major bumps of these packages would\nbreak the component at runtime for all users. Ignore semver-major updates\nfor react, react-dom, their type packages, @mui/material,\n@mui/icons-material, @emotion/react, @emotion/styled and adapter-react-v5\nso they are upgraded deliberately together with the Admin 8 migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014QBEo38Js52C32nXnTJj2b\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCZD7Wl5\n+diGAtfauB+j6XgzYLokTz5/QbbSwezVftt0PTwRGUY1EhnUnyjoLCzS/0Svqlj9Et293eMPXHds\n4wI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-09T10:59:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/5111fc09c638c49447364b2fbe2341506ec2cad3","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8R_l9oAKDUxMTFmYzA5YzYzOGM0OTQ0NzM2NGIyZmJlMjM0MTUwNmVjMmNhZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fischi87/ioBroker.utility-monitor/commit/2ae32903c31cfb793aa238097a0493de57fa8ac7","sha":"2ae32903c31cfb793aa238097a0493de57fa8ac7","