ata\n  via AI; uses 3-phase DB session pattern (read → close → AI call → fresh write)\n  to prevent idle-in-transaction hangs on long AI calls\n- DocumentTemplateGallery polls every 3s while status=\"processing\", shows spinner\n- Fix alembic migration chain (linearise two-head situation)\n- Add global FastAPI exception handler for 500 logging\n- Fix Celery task queue routing (celery → ai_queue)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76c0521a8595440a84dbab3c855cb23e54ac5980","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-by-fh/ai-job-analyzer/git/trees/76c0521a8595440a84dbab3c855cb23e54ac5980"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-by-fh/ai-job-analyzer/git/commits/f2287957a3f95418f75deaa0913fe409bdb0c674","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50704827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/code-by-fh","id":50704827,"login":"code-by-fh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzA0ODI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-by-fh/ai-job-analyzer/commit/f2287957a3f95418f75deaa0913fe409bdb0c674","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8VhNtoAKGYyMjg3OTU3YTNmOTU0MThmNzVkZWFhMDkxM2ZlN