"feat: deferred platform creation, URL-based setup wizard, URL-pattern fix\n\nDeferred Platform Creation:\n- Platform is only created when the setup wizard is completed (no more\n  orphaned pending_setup cards that couldn''t be crawled)\n- New URL-based endpoints: POST /platforms/preview-links and POST /platforms/setup\n- Frontend: PlatformSetupModal works URL-based (no platform.id needed),\n  JobPlatformsManager opens wizard without premature POST, reload-resilient\n  via ?setup_url= query param\n- DB migration: add setup_status and url_pattern columns\n\nURL-Pattern Inference Fix:\n- _infer_url_pattern now uses character-level os.path.commonprefix with\n  trim to last natural delimiter (/-_=?&.) instead of segment-level prefix\n- Fixes boards with job-ID in a single path segment (e.g. StepStone) that\n  previously collapsed to \"/\" and matched zero URLs on first crawl\n- 15 unit tests passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2b2c9d9d3cad2adf825dbd5782845176698d05d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-by-fh/ai-job-analyzer/git/trees/f2b2c9d9d3cad2adf825dbd5782845176698d05d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-by-fh/ai-job-analyzer/git/commits/05a32cb8354c497fb178df0f6614e4ba2a173b9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50704827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/code-by-fh","id":50704827,"login":"code-by-fh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzA0ODI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/code-by-fh/rec